# Kokomi Furina Nahida Mavuika. ~20s Rot. Kokomi Burgeon-Vape with Mavuika. Kokomi's skill heals over the setup period and is freshed with her burst. Kokomi stays on field until her burst expires before Nahida attemts to trigger fav. Burstless Nahida.

